  (text "TALOS CONTROLLER, prototype 0.5: seven motor channels (the gripper on the robot connector, the rail on J8), the currents through a multiplexer. See README.md." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "2a92ecba-f4c6-590a-b5cf-63f0c184f86d"))
  (text "Every pin ends in a label with its net name; parts with the same label are connected. Pins with a cross are not connected on purpose." (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "77e499cb-6483-52b7-943e-6c2468793afa"))
  (text "Channels follow the Eshed controller's axis numbering: 1 base, 2 shoulder, 3 elbow, 4 and 5 the two wrist motors, 6 the gripper (no switch), 7 the rail (on J8). Encoders 1 to 4 on the pulse counters, 5 to 7 counted in software." (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "d85c6bdc-fb2e-5976-9fd0-591b08703600"))
  (text "POWER ENTRY, FUSES, MOTORS ON RELAY AND E-STOP CHAIN" (at 25.4 45 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "14d7145c-122d-5013-9181-3d65f2094ad0"))
